{"id":"9ba06deeb328d7c2","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-prop-chain-condition.md","title":"Chain Condition","display":"prop-chain-condition — Chain Condition","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-chain-condition","aliases":["58-prop-chain-condition"],"display":"prop-chain-condition — Chain Condition","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-compatible.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-chain-condition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-chain-condition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-chain-condition — Chain Condition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2ad4b32e9e2eb12a\" href=\"?note=2ad4b32e9e2eb12a\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-compatible.md\">../batch08/58-df-compatible.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-countable.md\">../batch14/58-df-countable.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P,\\leq_P)\">\\((P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> (偏序参数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (偏序谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compatible}_P\">\\(\\mathrm{Compatible}_P\\)</span> (相容关系, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2ad4b32e9e2eb12a\" href=\"?note=2ad4b32e9e2eb12a\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-compatible.md\">../batch08/58-df-compatible.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}_S\\)</span> (可数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-countable.md\">../batch14/58-df-countable.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CCC}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CCC}_S\\)</span> (本文件定义的可数链条件谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}chain\\text{-}condition} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CCC}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\n\\forall A\\subseteq P\\;\\left[\n\\left(\\forall p,q\\in A\\;(p\\neq q\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Compatible}_P(p,q))\\right)\n\\to\\mathrm{Countable}_S(A)\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}chain\\text{-}condition} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CCC}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\n\\forall A\\subseteq P\\;\\left[\n\\left(\\forall p,q\\in A\\;(p\\neq q\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Compatible}_P(p,q))\\right)\n\\to\\mathrm{Countable}_S(A)\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>c.c.c. means every antichain is countable; the order is therefore part of the predicate's signature.</li>\n<li>Over ZFC, c.c.c. forcing preserves cardinals and cofinalities.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元